  id: k_banh_mi_bulgogi
  recipeName: "K-B\xE1nh M\xEC Bulgogi"
  region: Fusion
  basePrice: 140
  dishDescription: "V\u1ECF b\xE1nh m\xEC gi\xF2n tan k\u1EB9p th\u1ECBt b\xF2 Bulgogi n\u01B0\u1EDBng x\u1ED1t t\u01B0\u01A1ng m\xE8 v\xE0 kim chi cay gi\xF2n."
  culturalStory: "S\u1EF1 giao thoa tuy\u1EC7t v\u1EDDi gi\u1EEFa b\xE1nh m\xEC S\xE0i G\xF2n v\xE0 th\u1ECBt n\u01B0\u1EDBng Bulgogi Seoul, t\u1EA1o n\xEAn c\u01A1n s\u1ED1t \u1EA9m th\u1EF1c fusion \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c kh\xE1ch tr\u1EBB v\xF4 c\xF9ng y\xEAu chu\u1ED9ng."
  flavorProfile: "V\u1ECF gi\xF2n tan, th\u1ECBt b\xF2 ng\u1ECDt \u0111\u1EADm x\u1ED1t l\xEA t\u01B0\u01A1ng m\xE8, kim chi chua cay thanh gi\u1EA3m ng\u1EA5y"
  chefTip: "Th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng ch\xEDn t\u1EDBi tr\xEAn v\u1EC9 than ph\u1EA3i g\u1EAFp ngay v\xE0o b\xE1nh \u0111\u1EC3 ph\u1EA7n m\u1EE1 th\u1ECBt ng\u1EA5m v\xE0o ru\u1ED9t b\xE1nh"
